# Old VitePress URLs (https://nino.xgamedev.net/{lang}/doc/{page}) -> v4 docs.
# Anchors (#...) are kept by the browser. Pages whose old anchor moved to its
# own page in v4 (advanced) are listed in the docs' anchor redirects instead.
/en/doc/:page      /en/docs/v4/:page      301
/zh/doc/:page      /zh/docs/v4/:page      301
/en/doc            /en/docs/v4            301
/zh/doc            /zh/docs/v4            301
/en/perf/micro     /en/docs/v4/perf       301
/zh/perf/micro     /zh/docs/v4/perf       301
/en/perf           /en/docs/v4/perf       301
/zh/perf           /zh/docs/v4/perf       301

# Docs roots without a version
/en/docs           /en/docs/v4            302
/zh/docs           /zh/docs/v4            302

# Short links used in the Nino README
/en/start          /en/docs/v4/start      301
/zh/start          /zh/docs/v4/start      301
